# GPU step working files: inputs only. These are cut from the benchmark PDFs by
# select_pages.py, select_regions.py and select_bands.py, so they cost nothing to remake.
bench/gpu/pdfs/
bench/gpu/crops/
bench/gpu/crops_failing/
bench/gpu/bands/

# The model readings under bench/gpu/out*/ are NOT ignored, deliberately. They are the output of
# four paid GPU sessions, under two megabytes in all, and every run since 55 replays them from
# disk through --vision-endpoint file:. Losing them would make every score since unreproducible
# without renting a GPU again, and the repository has no remote to fall back on.

# The OmniDocBench evaluation toolkit (cloned, Apache-2.0, not our code)
bench/omnidocbench/
